        "original_id": "a75827ad-ffc5-598f-9e0c-314dba15775d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: OFAB-100-120, Sukhoi Su-30\n- Companies: Sukhoi Aviation Corporation\n- Places: Russia\n- Concepts: fighter aircraft, bomb, NATO reporting names\n\nFacts:\n- The Sukhoi Su-30 is a twin-engine, two-seat supermaneuverable fighter aircraft developed in Russia by Sukhoi Aviation Corporation.\n- The NATO reporting name for the Sukhoi Su-30 is Flanker-C.\n- The OFAB-100-120 is a small bomb.\n- The OFAB-100-120 can be carried on Sukhoi Su-17, Sukhoi Su-25, and Sukhoi Su-30 aircraft.",
